    narr:narration """On 20260713, [Dave's declarative commitment](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1783937875261_1) announced a switch from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline, citing a 10x query performance gain and lower licensing cost — framed as a done decision, not a proposal. Three session-level summary bullets echo and decompose that announcement: [the migration direction](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1783937875261_2) restates the source-to-target move, [the performance claim](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1783937875261_3) isolates the 10x figure, and [the timeline bullet](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1783937875261_4) pins execution to Q3 2026. The broader context node [analytics database modernization](narr:Narrative_AnalyticsDatabaseModernization) frames this as a shift toward higher query performance and lower cost as scale demands grow. The hub covers the decision, its stated rationale, and its schedule — but carries no dissent, no risk assessment, and no validation of the performance claim.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1783937875261_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1783937875261_2> ;
